{"4656440":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Drum Incremental","steam_appid":4656440,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click. Tap. Grow.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drum Incremental<\/strong> is an idle\/incremental game with a twist: instead of mindless clicking, every click <i>has rhythm<\/i>. You tap patterns on a practice pad, earn Rhythm Points, and use them to unlock new techniques, upgrade your gear, and watch your setup grow from a worn-out beginner's pad into a professional station.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No music experience required. The patterns teach themselves as you play.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it works<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click left and right mouse buttons to hit your drum pad following the current pattern. Complete cycles correctly, rack up your combo, and the points pour in. Unlock the metronome and your earnings multiply. Step away and your Study Companion keeps generating points while you're gone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 increasingly complex patterns<\/strong> — start simple, end up performing techniques used by professional drummers worldwide<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 progression phases<\/strong> with a Boss Exam to unlock each one — master what you have before moving forward<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive metronome<\/strong> with 4 speed tiers, each with its own synced original soundtrack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study Companion<\/strong> — an auto-clicker with personality that keeps earning points while you're away<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade shop<\/strong> — better pads, premium sticks, grip improvements, and companion upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 Steam Achievements<\/strong>, including a secret Platinum for those who master everything<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack<\/strong> composed and performed by Samuel Ruiz, live-synced to your tempo<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 languages<\/strong>: English, Spanish, German, French, Japanese, Portuguese (BR), Russian, Chinese, Korean, Turkish<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for everyone. Mastered by few.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to be a musician to enjoy Drum Incremental. The loop is simple: tap, earn, unlock, repeat. But underneath that simple loop lies a system built on real percussion techniques — and the deeper you go, the more satisfying it gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've never touched a drum in your life or you practice rudiments every day — there's something here for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with one pattern. Then another. Then keep going.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click. Tap. Grow.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drum Incremental<\/strong> is an idle\/incremental game with a twist: instead of mindless clicking, every click <i>has rhythm<\/i>. You tap patterns on a practice pad, earn Rhythm Points, and use them to unlock new techniques, upgrade your gear, and watch your setup grow from a worn-out beginner's pad into a professional station.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No music experience required. The patterns teach themselves as you play.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it works<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click left and right mouse buttons to hit your drum pad following the current pattern. Complete cycles correctly, rack up your combo, and the points pour in. Unlock the metronome and your earnings multiply. Step away and your Study Companion keeps generating points while you're gone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 increasingly complex patterns<\/strong> — start simple, end up performing techniques used by professional drummers worldwide<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 progression phases<\/strong> with a Boss Exam to unlock each one — master what you have before moving forward<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive metronome<\/strong> with 4 speed tiers, each with its own synced original soundtrack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study Companion<\/strong> — an auto-clicker with personality that keeps earning points while you're away<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade shop<\/strong> — better pads, premium sticks, grip improvements, and companion upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 Steam Achievements<\/strong>, including a secret Platinum for those who master everything<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack<\/strong> composed and performed by Samuel Ruiz, live-synced to your tempo<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 languages<\/strong>: English, Spanish, German, French, Japanese, Portuguese (BR), Russian, Chinese, Korean, Turkish<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for everyone. Mastered by few.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to be a musician to enjoy Drum Incremental. The loop is simple: tap, earn, unlock, repeat. But underneath that simple loop lies a system built on real percussion techniques — and the deeper you go, the more satisfying it gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've never touched a drum in your life or you practice rudiments every day — there's something here for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with one pattern. Then another. Then keep going.<\/p>","short_description":"A satisfying incremental game where every click has rhythm. Tap patterns, earn Rhythm Points, unlock new techniques, and build your ultimate setup. No music experience needed — just the urge to keep going.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Korean, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4656440\/fb94ab4be0b66f9677110449ae8a40f5a4a33724\/header.jpg?t=1793643062","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4656440\/f829e464f6a2f66286c89d7a98802ef1059d3e49\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793643062","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4656440\/f829e464f6a2f66286c89d7a98802ef1059d3e49\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793643062","website":"https:\/\/drumincremental.drumhazzard.net\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 1.5 GHz (doble núcleo)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 512 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GPU con soporte DirectX 12 (integrados Intel\/AMD válidos)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Dispositivo de audio estándar<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz (doble núcleo)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1024 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GPU dedicada con 512 MB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Dispositivo de audio estándar<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2026 Samuel Ruiz. All rights reserved.","developers":["Samuel Ruiz"],"publishers":["Samuel Ruiz"],"demos":[{"appid":4656470,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":799,"final":535,"discount_percent":33,"initial_formatted":"$7.99","final_formatted":"$5.35"},"packages":[1621290],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Drum Incremental","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1621290,"percent_savings_text":"-33% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Drum Incremental - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$7.99<\/span> $5.35","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":535}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4656440\/232f8f0f6b7afc48a3c9fdd35a8fe6057e3ce968\/ss_232f8f0f6b7afc48a3c9fdd35a8fe6057e3ce968.600x338.jpg?t=1793643062","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4656440\/232f8f0f6b7afc48a3c9fdd35a8fe6057e3ce968\/ss_232f8f0f6b7afc48a3c9fdd35a8fe6057e3ce968.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793643062"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4656440\/d3a77fc901708926dc17062a34f50917701b2a9a\/ss_d3a77fc901708926dc17062a34f50917701b2a9a.600x338.jpg?t=1793643062","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store